---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<Base
  title="About"
  description="SilentStars tracks open source projects that are actively built but chronically undervalued. No hype. Just signal."
>
  <div class="container section">

    <div class="about-hero">
      <p class="eyebrow">// what is this</p>
      <h1>The quiet part of open source</h1>
      <p class="lead">
        GitHub Trending shows you what's popular. SilentStars shows you what's <em>worth watching</em>.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="about-grid">

      <section class="about-card">
        <h2>// the problem</h2>
        <p>
          Stars are a popularity signal, not a quality signal. A project can have 12 stars and ship daily.
          Another can have 50k stars and be effectively abandoned. GitHub Trending, Hacker News, and most
          discovery tools reward hype — not craft.
        </p>
        <p>
          Thousands of maintainers build quietly: consistent commits, closed issues, steady releases.
          No launch. No Product Hunt. No Twitter thread. Just code.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="about-card">
        <h2>// how it works</h2>
        <p>
          Every night, SilentStars collects data from GitHub and computes two scores per project:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Undervalued Score</strong> — activity divided by visibility. High commits, low stars = undervalued.</li>
          <li><strong>Health Score</strong> — weighted combination of commit recency, cadence, issue resolution, and PR activity.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          Projects are classified as <em>Thriving</em>, <em>Newborn</em>, <em>Quiet</em>, <em>At Risk</em>, <em>Watched</em>, <em>Revived</em>, or <em>Archived</em>.
          On top of that, each project receives behavioral <strong>tags</strong> — signals like <em>solo_builder</em>, <em>hidden_gem</em>, <em>fork_magnet</em>, or <em>funded</em> — that drive the home page sections.
          No editorial bias. Pure signal.
        </p>
        <a href={`${base}projects/`} class="about-link">→ See all projects</a>
      </section>

      <section class="about-card">
        <h2>// who runs this</h2>
        <p>
          SilentStars is built and maintained by <a href="https://github.com/capuz" target="_blank" rel="noopener">capuz</a>.
          It runs on GitHub Pages with zero backend — nightly GitHub Actions collect data, Astro builds the static site.
        </p>
        <p>
          The <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" width="13" height="13" style="vertical-align:-2px" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18.244 2.25h3.308l-7.227 8.26 8.502 11.24H16.17l-4.714-6.231-5.401 6.231H2.746l7.73-8.835L1.254 2.25H8.08l4.253 5.622zm-1.161 17.52h1.833L7.084 4.126H5.117z"/></svg> bot <a href="https://x.com/silentstars_dev" target="_blank" rel="noopener">@silentstars_dev</a>
          posts one undervalued project daily.
        </p>
        <p>
          If SilentStars surfaces a project that changes how you work or think about open source, consider
          <a href="https://www.paypal.com/paypalme/fcapuz" target="_blank" rel="noopener">supporting it</a>.
          Zero cost. Zero backend. Built with care.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="about-card">
        <h2>// contribute</h2>
        <p>
          Know a project that deserves to be tracked? <a href={`${base}submit/`} class="about-link">Submit it via GitHub Issues</a> — the bot validates the repo instantly and, if accepted, adds it to the directory and posts it on X automatically.
        </p>
        <a href={`${base}submit/`} class="btn-submit">Submit a project →</a>
      </section>

    </div>

    <div class="about-subscribe">
      <p class="eyebrow">// stay in the loop</p>
      <p class="subscribe-desc">Weekly hidden gems — one digest, no noise.</p>
      <form
        id="about-newsletter-form"
        action="https://buttondown.com/api/emails/embed-subscribe/silentstars"
        method="post"
        target="popupwindow"
        class="subscribe-form"
      >
        <input type="email" name="email" required placeholder="your@email.com" class="subscribe-input" />
        <button type="submit" class="subscribe-btn">Subscribe</button>
      </form>
      <p id="about-newsletter-msg" class="subscribe-msg" aria-live="polite"></p>
      <p class="subscribe-also">
        Or follow <a href="https://x.com/silentstars_dev" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" width="13" height="13" style="vertical-align:-2px" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18.244 2.25h3.308l-7.227 8.26 8.502 11.24H16.17l-4.714-6.231-5.401 6.231H2.746l7.73-8.835L1.254 2.25H8.08l4.253 5.622zm-1.161 17.52h1.833L7.084 4.126H5.117z"/></svg> @silentstars_dev</a> for daily picks.
      </p>
    </div>

  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  .eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--f-mono);
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  .about-hero {
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  .about-hero h1 {
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 2.4rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }
  .lead {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
    max-width: 55ch;
  }

  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(420px, 1fr));
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }
  @media (max-width: 520px) { .about-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

  .about-card {
    border: 2px solid var(--ink);
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: var(--card);
    box-shadow: 2px 2px 0 var(--shadow);
    padding: 24px 28px;
  }
  .about-card h2 {
    font-family: var(--f-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .about-card p {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 0.85rem;
  }
  .about-card ul {
    padding-left: 1.1rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.85rem;
  }
  .about-card li {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
  }
  .about-card strong { color: var(--ink); }
  .about-card em { color: var(--accent); font-style: normal; font-weight: 600; }
  .about-card a { color: var(--accent); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 2px; }

  .about-link {
    font-family: var(--f-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--accent) !important;
  }

  .btn-submit {
    display: inline-block;
    font-family: var(--f-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    padding: 8px 18px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--ink);
    color: var(--paper) !important;
    text-decoration: none !important;
    transition: opacity .12s;
  }
  .btn-submit:hover { opacity: .8; }

  .about-subscribe {
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    border: 2px solid var(--accent);
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: var(--card);
    box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 var(--accent);
    padding: 2rem;
  }
  .subscribe-desc {
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .subscribe-form {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }
  .subscribe-input {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    background: var(--paper);
    border: 1.5px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 0.55em 1em;
    color: var(--ink);
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 200px;
    outline: none;
    transition: border-color 0.15s;
  }
  .subscribe-input:focus { border-color: var(--accent); }
  .subscribe-input::placeholder { color: var(--text-dim); }
  .subscribe-btn {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    background: var(--accent);
    color: #fff;
    padding: 0.55em 1.4em;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    border: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: opacity 0.15s;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .subscribe-btn:hover { opacity: 0.85; }
  .subscribe-msg {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--accent);
    min-height: 1.2em;
  }
  .subscribe-also {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
  }
  .subscribe-also a { color: var(--accent); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 2px; }
</style>
